      <section class="editorial-chapter">
        <h2>1. Overview and Operational Philosophy</h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>8PayCommission.com</strong>, accessible from [https://8paycommission.com](https://8paycommission.com), safeguarding the privacy of our visitors is a primary priority. This document outlines the categories of data recorded, received, and processed through our web portal, alongside the standards we uphold to protect your digital presence.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our platform functions primarily as an educational resource and computational simulator for public servants, military veterans, educators, and retirees across India. If you have additional questions or require further clarification regarding our privacy practices, please contact our administrative desk at <a href="mailto:dailylifetech.official@gmail.com">dailylifetech.official@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="editorial-chapter">
        <h2>2. Zero-Storage Policy for Salary & Pension Calculators</h2>
        <p>
          A cornerstone of our platform is our strict, client-side approach to data processing:
        </p>
        <div class="highlight-callout">
          <h4>Client-Side Execution Guarantee:</h4>
          <p>
            Whenever you utilize our interactive tools—including the 8th Pay Commission Salary Calculator, Arrears Estimator, Pension Multiplier, or DA/HRA Simulator—<strong>all mathematical evaluations take place locally inside your web browser</strong> using client-side JavaScript.
          </p>
          <p>
            We do not transmit, log, record, harvest, or retain your basic pay figures, pay band selections, gratuity values, pension amounts, or net income totals on any server or external database. When you refresh or close your browser tab, your entered numbers are immediately discarded.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="editorial-chapter">
        <h2>3. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on how you interact with our website, certain technical or voluntary information may be collected:
        </p>
        <ul class="bullet-feature-list">
          <li><strong>Log Files:</strong> Like standard web platforms, 8PayCommission.com utilizes log files. Information collected includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date/time stamps, referring/exit pages, and the number of clicks. This data is not linked to personally identifiable information and is used exclusively for site maintenance, trend analysis, and server security monitoring.</li>
          <li><strong>Voluntary Communications:</strong> When you contact us directly via email at <a href="mailto:dailylifetech.official@gmail.com">dailylifetech.official@gmail.com</a>, we receive your email address, your name (if included in your email client signature), and the specific contents or attachments of your message. This correspondence is used strictly to answer your questions and provide technical or editorial support.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="editorial-chapter">
        <h2>4. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
        <p>
          8PayCommission.com uses standard cookies to enhance user experience. Cookies are small text files placed on your device to store preferences and record page-level visitor trends.
        </p>
        <p>
          These cookies help us optimize our site speed, maintain layout rendering across desktop and mobile screens, and ensure responsive page delivery. You can disable cookies at any time through your individual browser settings. Detailed guidance on cookie management can be found directly on your browser provider's official support website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="editorial-chapter">
